// REFAL - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// REFAL is a rewriting language: a program is a set of rules, and
// its only output is PRINT, which concatenates the two sides of the
// first rule that matches. There is no other way to say anything.
PRINT:3 "Hello World!"
